# SupremeOS native-linux — Apple TV bridge environment.
#
# Direct counterpart to infra/hub-compose/docker-compose.yml's `appletv` service
# `environment:` block. Docker's value is a fixed in-container path (/data/appletv-
# creds.json, backed by the `appletv-data` named volume); this is the native equivalent
# under this deployment's own data directory.
#
# Rendered to /etc/supremeos/appletv.env (mode 0640, owned root:supreme) by install.sh.

SUPREME_APPLETV_DATA="___SUPREME_DATA_DIR___/appletv/appletv-creds.json"
